-*   **Child Index**: Integer $i \in [0, 7]$.
+**Isotopic variant**: Subdivide leaves until $0 \notin \Box F(C) \lor \langle \Box \nabla F(C), \Box \nabla F(C) \rangle > 0$, then balance the octree [S3].
 
